# Function Inspection: `ReturnType` and `Parameters` 🔬

Inspect and extract types from existing functions without re-typing their signatures:

```typescript
function fetchUserById(id: number) {
  return { id, name: "Alice", active: true };
}

// Extract the return type of the function!
type UserReturn = ReturnType<typeof fetchUserById>;
// Inferred as { id: number; name: string; active: boolean }

// Extract the parameters tuple!
type UserParams = Parameters<typeof fetchUserById>;
// Inferred as [id: number]

const userSample: UserReturn = { id: 2, name: "Bob", active: false };
console.log("User Sample:", userSample);
```

