# Unwrapping Promises with `Awaited<T>` ⏳

Unwraps the inner resolved value type from nested Promises:

```typescript
async function getApiResponse() {
  return { status: 200, message: "OK" };
}

// Unwraps Promise<{ status: number, message: string }>
type UnwrappedData = Awaited<ReturnType<typeof getApiResponse>>;

const responsePayload: UnwrappedData = { status: 200, message: "Success" };
console.log("Unwrapped status:", responsePayload.status);
```

